{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>The remainder of the spoil.</b> Apart from what they consumed; therefore he said 'the remainder,' and he mentioned their number, because it was a large number, and we have not heard of spoil like it. Likewise he mentioned the levy, because it too was large. The word מכם is of the doubled [forms], on the pattern of וממר ליולדתו, and it is from the derivation of תכסו על השה, and the meaning is 'portion.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {0 "The words מכם and וממר are not fully pointed in the manuscripts I consulted; I have transliterated them as they appear without resolving vowels. The phrase מפועלי הכפל is obscure and may be textually uncertain; I translate it hyper-literally as 'of the doubled [forms].' The reference תכסו על השה could not be identified with any biblical verse; it is translated as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:02.798509624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}